kg:note_ref8090_scopecontent_0_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdf:value "- FSA A.6 03.011, on which Joseph Upton's classification mentions \"N-11\", provides Herzfeld's sketches of various Sassanid (Sasanian) seals with transliterated inscriptions and notes in English. As well, three series of loose slips provides thumbnail sketches and notes in German or English, on various stamp seals, from the private collection of Assyrian antiquities of Mr. De Clercq, as well as collections from Berlin Museum, British Museum, and the Bibliothèque Nationale, Paris." .

kg:note_ref8090_scopecontent_1_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
