    rdf:value "- In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-11 reads, \"Sasanian seal-stones, many with inscriptions. P.1 is marked \"Calcutta,\" but it is uncertain whether that refers to all pages from 1 to 45. The loose slips are of objects mostly in European museum collections.\"" .

