    rdf:value "- FSA A.6 03.071, on which Joseph Upton's classification mentions \"N-71\", provides Ernst Herzfeld's personal diary for the year 1923. The earliest registered entry dates, \"Jan. 1, 1923\", and the latest registered entry dates, \"Dec. 22, 1923\"." .

