    rdf:value "- Additional information from staff reads: \"The entries fom Dec. 23, 1923 to Dec. 31, 1923 are missing.\"" .

kg:note_ref8279_scopecontent_2_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdf:value "- Additional information from staff reads: \"As in many other diaries, Herzfeld has written the anniversary dates related to his father, mother, and sisters.\"" .

kg:note_ref8279_scopecontent_3_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdf:value "- Additional information from staff reads: \"On July 18, 1923, while in Tehran, Herzfeld has reported a visit to the photographer Antoin Sevruguin.\"" .

kg:note_ref8279_scopecontent_4_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdf:value "- In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-71, reads, \"Diary, 1923. Much of the information repeated in Journal N-83.\"" .

