kg:note_ref8345_scopecontent_0_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdf:value "- FSA A.6 03.093, on which Joseph Upton's classification mentions \"N-93\", provides a long list of archaeological publications included in Ernst Herzfeld personal library. The list, written in 1918 probably by Herzfeld, is organized by authors in alphabetical order and contains purchased prices in German Mark currency following each entry." .

kg:note_ref8345_scopecontent_1_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdf:value "- Additional information from staff reads: \"FSA A.6 03.093 covers part I of Herzfeld personal library; FSA A.6 03.094 covers part II.\"" .

