        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-21, p. 2 reads, \"Ashmolean Museum. Terra cotta figurine of goddess.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-21, p. 3 reads, \"Ashmolean Museum. Small gold crouching calf; stone (?) goat.\"",
