    crm:P3_has_note "Arrangement In the original arrangement of the Ernst Herzfeld Archive, Notebooks were included in a larger body of diverse material acknowledged by Ernst Herzfeld as his study collection. In the early 1970s, Joseph Upton, for research purpose, rearranged the collection and created a specific series (Ernst Herzfeld Papers, Series 3: Notebooks, 1904-1946, 1957, n.d.) for 131 notebooks, including four ledgers and eight travel journals. Upton has given this notebook an accession number, N-87, related to the series he created for the notebooks, probably following Herzfeld's original organization.",
        "Local Numbers Ernst Herzfeld Papers, N-87 FSA A.6 03.087",
        "Scope and Contents - Additional information from staff reads: \"Inserted in the notebook, an handwritten page which caption reads, \"Corpus Inscriptionum Partharicarum\".\"",
        "Scope and Contents - FSA A.6 03.087, on which Joseph Upton's classification mentions \"N-87\", provides several Pahlavi Inscriptions that were recorded during Herzfeld's expeditions in Persia between 1923 and 1926. These inscriptions are from rock reliefs, ancient palaces, graffitis, coins, bullae and seals.",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 1 reads, \"Sarpul.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 109 reads, \"Unidentified.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 110 reads, \"Taxila, Asoka inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 117 reads, \"Inscribed seal-stone.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 12 reads, \"Inscriptions on four Sasanian seal-stones.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 16 reads, \"Persepolis, Tachara.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 17 reads, \"Five masters' signatures: Naqsh-i Rustam, Naqsh-i Rajab, Persepolis.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 23 reads, \"Three seal-stones: two Pahlavi, one Arabic.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 30 reads, \"Bistun, Greek inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 35 reads, \"Stone masters' signatures: Taq-i Girra, Bistun, Firuzabad.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 36 reads, \"Arabic and Pahlavi inscriptions on coins.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 4 reads, \"Naqsh-i Rajab.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 63 reads, \"Seal-stones with Pahlavi and Arabic inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 66 reads, \"Arabic coin inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 67 reads, \"Parthian coins.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 72 reads, \"Two Parthian coins, inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 73 reads, \"Soghdian coin inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 95 reads, \"Naqsh-i Rustam and Kuh-i Girdelak.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 96 reads, \"Istakhr, city-gate.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 97 reads, \"Sasanian coin inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 98 reads, \"Firuzabad.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 107 and 108 reads, \"Shapur (Bishapur).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 111 to 114 reads, \"Inscribed bullae.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 115 and 116 reads, \"Mil-i Radkan.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 118 and 119 reads, \"Turfan, Hephthalite.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 13 to 15 reads, \"Naqsh-i Rajab, Kartīr inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 18 to 22 reads, \"Persepolis, Hebrew inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 2 and 3 reads, \"Naqsh-i Rustam, Pahlavi and Greek.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 24 to 29 reads, \"Naqsh-i Rustam, Kartīr inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 31 to 34 reads, \"Persepolis, European graffiti.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 37 to 52 reads, \"Paikuli, new blocks.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 5 to 8 reads, \"Naqsh-i Rustam.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 53 to 56 reads, \"Imamzadeh Shah Isma'il, astodan inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 57 to 62 reads, \"Inscriptions on Sasanian and Parthian coins.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 64 and 65 reads, \"Sasanian coins.\"",
