        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 74 and 81 reads, \"Nineteen Sasanian and Parthian coins in the collection of Mustishar-i a'zam, Shiraz.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 82 and 83 reads, \"Comparison of script on silver vessels with that at Imamzadeh Shah Isma'il.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 84 to 89 reads, \"Stakhrian coins in British Museum, inscriptions.\"",
