        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-106, p. 76 reads, \"Susa, stamped tile, inscription and transliteration.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-106, p. 88 reads, \"Hamadan, Hebrew inscription, Esther's tomb.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-106, p. 89 reads, \"Damavand, Arabic inscription (Mar. 12, 1927).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-106, p. 93 reads, \"Hamadan, bronze dagger, cuneiform inscription and transliteration.\"",
