    crm:P3_has_note "Arrangement In the original arrangement of the Ernst Herzfeld Archive, Notebooks were included in a larger body of diverse material acknowledged by Ernst Herzfeld as his study collection. In the early 1970s, Joseph Upton, for research purpose, rearranged the collection and created a specific series (Ernst Herzfeld Papers, Series 3: Notebooks, 1904-1946, 1957, n.d.) for 131 notebooks, including four ledgers and eight travel journals. Upton has given this notebook an accession number, N-107, related to the series he created for the notebooks, probably following Herzfeld's original organization.",
        "General - Title is provided by Xavier Courouble, FSg Archives cataloger, based on Joseph Upton's Catalogue of the Herzfeld Archive.",
        "Local Numbers Ernst Herzfeld Papers; N-107 FSA A.6 03.107",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 1 reads, \"Pasargadae. Palace S, cuneiform inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 10 reads, \"Pasargadae. Tomb of Cyrus, Arabic inscriptions of mihrāb.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 2 reads, \"Pasargadae. Palace P, cuneiform inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 25 reads, \"Arabic inscription of Shaikh Omar Suhrawardi.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 26 reads, \"Arabic inscription on tile of Shaikh 'Umar, Baghdad.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 29 reads, \"Sardonix seal with cuneiform and transliteration.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 3 reads, \"Pasargadae. Palace S, fragment of cuneiform inscription with transliteration.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 45 reads, \"Persepolis. Door-knob with cuneiform and transcription (May 3, 1931).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 48 reads, \"Persepolis. Stone-masons marks, Harem.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 49 reads, \"Persepolis. Hadish, Sasanian graffiti.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 54 reads, \"Persepolis. Hadish, cuneiform on King's robe.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 55 reads, \"Persepolis. European graffiti and Pahlavik inscribed weight from Shamsabad.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 61 reads, \"Persepolis. Tachara, cuneiform inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 62 reads, \"Persepolis. Tachara, fragment cuneiform inscription with transliteration (July 12, 1932).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 63 reads, \"Persepolis. Tachara, two fragments cuneiform with transliteration (July 12, 1932).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 72 reads, \"Hamadan, silver dish, cuneiform inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 73 reads, \"Persepolis. Apadāna, glazed tile frieze (Feb. 17, 1933).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 74 reads, \"Persepolis. Clay tablet with cuneiform inscription (Nov. 23, 1932).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 8 reads, \"Pasargadae. Stone-masons marks near tomb of Cyrus.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, p. 9 reads, \"Pasargadae. Tomb of Cyrus, Arabic inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, pp. 11 to 24 reads, \"Pasargadae. Measurements and notes for map. April-May, 1928.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, pp. 27 and 28 reads, \"Arabic inscription on jug from Basra, Coll.Mr. Monk, Baghdad.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, pp. 30 to 44 reads, \"Persepolis. Tomb of Artaxerxes III. 30 excerpts cuneiform inscription with transcriptions (June 23, 1931). Refer to throne-bearers.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, pp. 4 to 7 reads, \"Pasargadae. Palace P, fragments of cuneiform inscription with transliteration.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, pp. 46 and 47 reads, \"Persepolis. Fragments cuneiform inscriptions with transcription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, pp. 50 to 53 reads, \"Persepolis. Lists of inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, pp. 56 to 60 reads, \"Persepolis, 48-line cuneiform inscription with transliteration (Oct. 3, 1931).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, pp. 64 to 68 reads, \"Persepolis. Fragments with cuneiform inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-107, pp. 69 to 71 reads, \"Persepolis. Fragments of cuneiform inscriptions found in Fratadara temple. Sept. 14-22, 1932.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Original handwritten title on cover reads: \"Keil Inschriften II.\"" ;
