    crm:P3_has_note "Arrangement In the original arrangement of the Ernst Herzfeld Archive, Notebooks were included in a larger body of diverse material acknowledged by Ernst Herzfeld as his study collection. In the early 1970s, Joseph Upton, for research purpose, rearranged the collection and created a specific series (Ernst Herzfeld Papers, Series 3: Notebooks, 1904-1946, 1957, n.d.) for 131 notebooks, including four ledgers and eight travel journals. Upton has given this notebook an accession number, N-109, related to the series he created for the notebooks, probably following Herzfeld's original organization.",
        "General - In Finding Aid, a Joseph Upton's note (missing) says, \"Received from Prof. Grohmann on October 29, 1957,\" followed by, \"The first pages of the notebook are unnumbered, but consist of the following items: 1 page of Persian words with their probable Pahlavi origins; 7 pages of measurements for a map of Shahristan; 4 pages of what seems to be a study of the marking on Kushan coins; bibliographical notes on Qa'in, Turbat-i Haidari and Khwaf; 3 pages of a parody in verse of a New Year's party. The inscriptions through 46 are numbered in red.\"",
        "General - Title is provided by Xavier Courouble, FSg Archives cataloger, based on Joseph Upton's Catalogue of the Herzfeld Archive.",
        "Local Numbers Ernst Herzfeld Papers; N-109 FSA A.6 03.109",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 1 reads, \"Peshawar Museum, Kufic, 482 H.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 19 reads, \"Nishapur. Shaikh 'Attar, excerpts from tombstone inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 19a reads, \"Potsherds from Nishapur and Bistam.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 2 reads, \"Bombay Museum, Kufic on sarcophagus (Koranic).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 22 reads, \"Paqaleh (near Mehr (Revand)), Kufic.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 27 reads, \"Bistan. Iwan between 1st and 2nd courts of Mashhad (Shrine).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 29 reads, \"Bistan. Mosque of Bayazid, Kufic.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 32 and 32a reads, \"Mil-i Radkan. Kufic cornice inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 33 reads, \"Mil-i Radkan. Remains of Kufic door inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 34 reads, \"Mil-i Radkan. Pahlavi inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 35 reads, \"Damghan. Pir 'Alamdar, Kufic.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 36 reads, \"Damghan. Pir 'Alamdar, fragment Kufic door-post inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 37 reads, \"Damghan. Minaret, Chehelsutun, Kufic.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 38 reads, \"Damghan. Minaret, Cheheldukhtaran, Kufic door inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 39 reads, \"Damghan. Cheheldukhtaran, building inscription, 446 H.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 40 reads, \"Damghan. Minaret, Masjid-i Jami', upper Kufic inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 41 reads, \"Damghan. Minaret, Masjid-i Jami', lower inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 44 reads, \"Damghan. Turbe in courtyard of Imamzadeh Ja'far, Shahrukh inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 45 reads, \"Simnan. Minaret of Masjid-i Jum'a. Kufic.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 46 reads, \"Simnan. Gr. Iwan, Masjid-i Jum'a, 828 H.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 47 reads, \"Damghan, Pir \"Alamdar, painted Kufic inscription.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 48 reads, \"Tow forged inscriptions on printed silks from Rayy.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 49 reads, \"Floral Kufic inscription on bronze object.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 50 reads, \"Tehran, Library of Palace. Illuminated Shahnama, prose Arabic introduction, 833 H.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 51 reads, \"Tehran, Library of Palace. Further notes on manuscripts and miniatures.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 52 reads, \"Kabul. Notes on 2-vol. Kufic Koran, parchment.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 53 reads, \"Kabul. Notes on 1-vol. Kufic Koran, parchment.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 54 reads, \"Kabul. Small Kufic Koran, paper.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-109, p. 55 reads, \"Nizamabad, Kufic graffito. Twenty-seven un-numbered pages of measurements for plan of Shahristan.\"",
