        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 40 reads, \"Sawah, large tiles from minaret, 504 H. Kufic.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 41 reads, \"Isfahan, window lintel 563 H. on street Maidan to old Chaharbagh.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 42 reads, \"Zahidan, tombstone 852 H.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 43 reads, \"Milestone of Harun al-Rashid from Egypt (in Munich Exposition, 1910).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 44 reads, \"Bronze vessel (Coll. Sidney Barney. London. Oct.23, 1935). Kufic inscription, Sasanian style decoration.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 45 reads, \"Another bronze, same owner and date, 782 H. \"Looks Mamluk, but at same time, Persian\".\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 53 reads, \"Unidentified inscriptions.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 54 reads, \"Sin (near Isfahan. M.B.Smith, Nov. 1935). Minaret inscription 526?, Kufic.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 55 reads, \"Sin (near Isfahan. M.B.Smith, Nov. 1935). Carved and painted plaster inscription, 529 H..\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, p. 56 reads, \"Unidentified Pahlavi inscription, apparently also with Kufic date. Note says \"Kufic date apparently 413, corresponding to 389 of Tab (aristan) era\".\"",
