        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, pp. 12 and 13 reads, \"Inscriptions on clay jug from Basra (Coll. Mr. Monk, Baghdad).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-110, pp. 2 to 8 reads, \"Isfahan, Safavid inscriptions.\"",
