        mbs:FileUnit ;
    rdfs:label "N-32: Contains draft outline of chapter headings and sub-headings for The Persian Empire , with identification of 17 proposed illustrations. See N-120/121 for Ms. edited and published posthumously by Prof. Gerold Walser, 1968. The first chapter, \"The Horse in the Ancient East...,\" bears a notation \"Verőffentl. d. Türk. Geschichts Kommission, V. Serie. No.2a. Ausgrabungen von Alaca Hőyük von Dr. Hēmit Zübeyr Koşay (Ankara, 1944). Der Gold-eisen dolch (?) in dem darauf folgenden Nummern.\" The notebook also contains miscellaneous notes related to the study" ;
    dct:identifier "FSA A.6 03.032" ;
