    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - Additional information from staff reads: \"Herzfeld has listed these objects by categories including among others pottery, bronze, tablets (Sassanid bullae included), and gold objects. He also has diversely applied to the majority of the objects a sketch; a physical description; and currency prices in Indian Rupee.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

