    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-98 reads, \"\"Feurtempel. [Drafts?] for an article on Fire Temples, including Masjid-i Sulaiman (Nov. 1928); Takht-i Rustam (Sept. 1923); Kūh-i Khwāja (1924, 1929); Shahristan (Feb. 11-14, 1925); Firuzabad (Ardashir Khurrah) (March, 1924); Qaleh-i Dukhtar (1925); and Girah (Sar Mashhad) (Mar. 29, 1924). A revised version starts on p.16. Includes quotations from N-84, for instance, on pp.2-4 .\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

