    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, Joseph Upton's caption for N-115 reads, \"Entries from Sept. 1-14th, 1905 in Gothic script. Beginning of trip from Schergat, reported in Journal N-81.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

