        crm:E35_Title ;
    rdfs:label "N-128: 6. Manila folder of blueprints of unpublished Pahlavik or Parthian squeezes. A note on the cover (which also includes folder 5) by P. de Menasce says: \"Blueprints. These are photographs of E.H.'s latestsqueezes mostly unpublished or photographed anew.\" The numbers on the backs are from Herzfeld's last copy" ;
    rdf:value "N-128: 6. Manila folder of blueprints of unpublished Pahlavik or Parthian squeezes. A note on the cover (which also includes folder 5) by P. de Menasce says: \"Blueprints. These are photographs of E.H.'s latestsqueezes mostly unpublished or photographed anew.\" The numbers on the backs are from Herzfeld's last copy" .

