    rdfs:label "N-90: Inventory of Herzfeld's Collection. Nos.1--1864 are, in general, a duplication of the entries in N-89, except for the following: entries 105--120 differ from those in N-89; entry 786 is a stone statuette, in N-89 it is a bronze lamp, each missing in the other volume; 3 unnumbered bowls between entries 1543--44 in N-89 are not in N-90. Also included in N-90 are entries 2885--2980, mostly objects from Nihavand and Harsin" ;
