kg:physical_ref8343 a crm:E22_Human_Made_Object,
        mbs:DocumentaryFile,
        mbs:PhysicalComponent ;
    rdfs:label "N-91: Inventory of Herzfeld's Collection. Continuation of N-89, Nos. 2032--2884 (No.2032 is used twice, once for another coin in N-89). No prices are entered after 2535. Nos.2261--2511 are headed \"Tepe Giyān, Fall 1926-Spring 1927.\" There are frequent references to photos or sketchbook entries and many of the objects are noted as in the Field Museum, Chicago" ;
